	(text "Power Draw:\n	MCU: 40mA\n	Speaker/AMP: 800mA * 2\n	(In practice draws no more than 400mA each so 800mA total max)\n	SD Card: 100mA\n	Buttons/LEDs: ~5mA\n	LED Board(s): 120mA\nTotal: 1045mA\n\nNote: The MAX98357 can draw up to 1.5A @ 5V when at max gain.\nTherefore, it should be used at half that or less*.\n*Testing has shown much lower so max gain is safe"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
